DESCRIPTION:Mother’s Day SUP Yoga on the Petaluma River\, “Petaluma’
 s Longest Park” Hey\, MOM! We know what you want. Peace and quiet. Time 
 to reflect. Time to not reflect. Time to float. Time to flow. Step away fr
 om the rush and into the quiet of the Petaluma River for a peaceful SUP Yo
 ga experience with The Floathouse Petaluma . We’re moms too. We know….
