 in-x) var(--origin-y)\; } Though we launch from the heart of downtown\, th
 e central turning basin offers a surprisingly serene setting—calm water\
 , open sky\, and a sense of ease that feels far removed from daily life. T
 his all-levels\, 90-minute session is designed for everyone: experienced y
 ogis\, seasoned paddle boarders\, and complete beginners alike. We begin w
 ith a short\, gentle paddle from the docks to get comfortable on your boar
 d (knees are always welcome). Once we reach our practice spot\, we anchor 
 together so tidal movement won’t interrupt your flow. From there\, you
 ’re invited to move\, breathe\, rest\, or simply be—guided by an exper
 ienced instructor and supported by the shared rhythm of water and communit
 y. All equipment is provided\, including extra-stable paddleboards measuri
 ng 34 inches wide and 11 feet long—much larger than a yoga mat and desig
 ned to help you feel grounded and secure on the water. Come as you are. Ch
 oose your own level of effort. Flow with the river and the people around y
 ou. You deserve it. It’s YOUR river. Come out and play. $50/person\, inc
 ludes all gear\, instruction\, and quality time on the water. #block-yui_3
