BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Upstream High Tide Paddle 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T160000
UID:a17450fc94907e2d216a63021ac46528@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1766988489003-E3BDKAIM0H1AN5I5VSHL/Undated+Upstream
 +High+Tide+Paddle+Squarespace+event+page+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Upstream High Tide Paddle [High Tide: ~5.4 feet] When the tide
  rises\, the river reveals a hidden world. Join The Floathouse crew for a 
 gentle\, guided paddle upstream on a high tide of 5.4 feet \, when the Pet
 aluma River opens into its quieter\, greener reaches. With extra water ben
 eath us\, we’re able to glide beyond the downtown channel and into a tra
 nquil tidal slough—an ever-changing habitat rich with birdlife and natur
 al beauty. Book your upstream adventure here. ($60/person includes gear\, 
 guide and nature’s awesomeness.) As we drift upstream\, keep an eye out 
 for great egrets\, blue herons\, snowy egrets\, turtles basking along the 
 banks \, and the lush plant life that thrives where freshwater and tides m
 eet. The pace is unhurried\, the water is calm\, and the experience is dee
 ply grounding—many guests say they can feel their stress melt away withi
 n minutes. Along the way\, our guide shares stories of the flora\, fauna\,
  and human history that have shaped this upper channel—from its ecologic
 al importance to its role in Petaluma’s past as a working river. You’l
 l come away with a deeper appreciation for how close this wild place is to
  the heart of downtown. ✨ Beginner-friendly 🚣 Sit-on-top kayaks 🌊 
 High tide access makes this route possible 🌿 A peaceful\, nature-forwar
 d experience Come explore the Petaluma River at one of its most magical mo
 ments—when the tide is high\, the river is deep\, and the wild feels won
 derfully close. Book here. #block-c6d7f43d2d2481f06681 { --stroke-style: n
 one\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background-color: initia
 l\; } #block-c6d7f43d2d2481f06681 .sqs-html-content { --tweak-text-block-p
 adding: 6% 6% 6% 6%\; --tweak-text-block-padding: initial\; } #block-c6d7f
 43d2d2481f06681 { mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend )\; border-
 radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius)\; } #block-c6d7f43d2d2481f06681 { -
 -tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px\; } #block-c6d7f43d2d2481f06681 
