BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downriver Run with Optional Sauna Refresh Sesh 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T170000
UID:d275071313aba73c527c484683e49a87@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1766992270933-MW5ZCIEWI2559JS4ZGRS/Downriver+Escape
 +with+Optional+Sauna+Reset+Squarespace+event+page+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Downriver Run + Optional Sauna Refresh Sesh 📅 Saturday\, Ma
 y 16 ⏰ Downriver Run: 3-5 pm. Optional Sauna + Cold Plunge: 5-6:30 pm Go
  with the flow. Ride the tide. Find the vibe. Join the crew from The Float
 house for a one-way\, two-hour glide downriver in Hobie pedal kayaks—pow
 ered by your legs and the outgoing tide. This slow-lane journey follows th
 e Petaluma River south of town\, slipping quietly through hidden wetlands 
 and tidal habitat that most people never see\, and that can’t be accesse
 d any other way. As the tide carries you along\, you’ll pedal approximat
 ely six miles \, moving effortlessly through a living landscape of reeds\,
  birds\, and broad skies. Egrets lift off ahead of you\, herons stand sent
 inel along the banks\, and the river widens into its wilder self. Along th
 e way\, we’ll share stories of this working tidal slough—its ecology\,
  its rhythms\, and why this stretch of river matters. At the finish\, rewa
 rd yourself with the optional Refresh Sesh at Sundrop Sauna . Step into th
 e heat\, rinse\, reset\, and leave feeling energized—inside and out. Beg
 inner-friendly. Unforgettable. Be part of nature—and let the tide do the
  work. Book here. ($85 for downriver run\, $125 for downriver run + sauna 
 refresh sesh) Includes all gear\, snacks and drinks at the sauna\, and sau
 na &amp\; cold plunge experience. Bring towel\, swimming suit\, slides. Ho
 bie pedal kayaks provided. Transportation details\, meeting point\, and sa
 una timing shared after registration. Note: Most folks arrange for their o
 wn transportation back to town\, but with advance notice\, one of our staf
 f members or volunteers can give you a ride. #block-45678b0a009d4410814b {
  --stroke-style: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-backgr
