DESCRIPTION:Lazy Sunday mornings and a little time on the river—what cou
 ld be better? Join The Floathouse crew from 9:45–11:15 AM for a Sunday F
 unday SUP Paddle on the Petaluma River\, also known as Petaluma’s Longes
 t Park . It’s an easygoing\, social paddle that gets you outside\, movin
 g a bit\, and enjoying the water before the rest of your day unfolds. Here
 ’s your chance to get out and enjoy the day! Everything’s included: a 
 stable TAO Fit paddleboard\, paddle\, PFD\, and good company . Paddle for 
 about an hour or stay out for the full outing—we keep things relaxed and
  welcoming. When you’re done\, you’re already right downtown \, just s
 teps from some of Petaluma’s favorite coffee spots\, bakeries\, and brun
 ch tables . Come for the paddle\, then wander into town and keep the Sunda
 y vibe going. 💲 General Public: $30 (60–90 minutes on the water. Stil
 l a deal\, as our normal 60-minute SUP rental is $30) 💙 SUP-PER Club Me
 mbers: included as part of your membership Not a member yet? The SUP-PER C
 lub never expires and includes 11 outings for $150 —about $13 per paddle
  . A great deal if you love getting out on the water with us. 👉 Book yo
 ur Sunday Funday SUP Paddle here! 👉 Join the SUP-PER Club here! Meet th
 e day on the water. The Floathouse crew will take care of the rest. #block
