BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Full Blue Moon Paddle/Pedal 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T213000
UID:255890fd97d2499d4dda9052a2c3621a@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1768435703190-GEVO3IVGKJ981F2K8NT1/Blue+Moon+Paddle
 Pedal+May+30+2026+squarespace+event+image+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:🌕 Blue Moon Paddle / Pedal Saturday\, May 30\, 2026 | 7:30
 –9:30 pm The Floathouse Join us for a rare and beautiful evening on Peta
 luma River —Petaluma’s Longest Park—under a Blue Moon \, the second 
 full moon of the month. (The first graced us on May 1st\; this is the enco
 re.) Our tagline says it all: Come Play on the River at Night. In our Hobi
 e pedal kayaks\, it truly feels like play. No matter the tide\, and even i
 f the evening breeze picks up\, we’ll simply pedal along—effortless an
 d smooth—about a mile and a half downriver to the spot where the moon ri
 ses over the wetlands that frame our horizon. This guided nighttime paddle
  is designed to help you slow down\, reconnect\, and share a little moonli
 t magic with your community. Glide across calm\, reflective water\, watch 
 the moon lift into the sky\, and experience the river in a way few ever do
 . $60 per person includes everything: Hobie pedal kayak PFD and safety lig
 hts Experienced guide A memorable\, moonlit river experience ✨ Rare. Pla
 yful. Peaceful. Come join us on the river. Book here. #block-6f81de4a776bf
