BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Learn to SUP: Build skills. Find flow. Love the river. 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T120000
UID:0df2190145460705ba1c4c57b85393f6@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1771550281507-265ECDHT7D3N331PAKVN/Learn+to+SUP+wit
 h+us++2026+Squarespace+image+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Learn to SUP: Build Skills. Find Flow. Ready to feel confident
  on a paddleboard? Our Learn to SUP class is a welcoming\, two-hour introd
 uction designed to help you paddle smarter — not harder — so you can t
 ruly enjoy your time on the water. Start your SUP journey here. For just $
 60 \, you’ll learn from an ACA-certified (American Canoe Association) in
 structor in a small\, supportive group of just 2–6 students . That means
  personalized attention\, real feedback\, and space to grow. We’ll cover
 : Proper stance and balance Efficient paddle technique Turning and maneuve
 ring Launching and returning to the dock River awareness and safety basics
  Many people hop on a board and think they’re having fun — but they’
 re working twice as hard as they need to. This class unlocks the “aha”
  moments that make paddleboarding smoother\, more efficient\, and way more
  enjoyable. Held right in the heart of downtown Petaluma on the beautiful 
 Petaluma River\, this is your chance to build skills in a calm\, supportiv
 e environment — and start feeling at home on the water. Bring a friend\,
  learn together\, and find your flow. All equipment included. Only 6 paddl
 ers per class. Book your spot early. #block-8ca7d258561c01d66507 { --strok
 e-style: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background-col
 or: initial\; } #block-8ca7d258561c01d66507 .sqs-html-content { --tweak-te
 xt-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%\; --tweak-text-block-padding: initial\; } #b
