BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Community Yoga on The Floathouse Dock—First Fridays 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T190000
UID:7ab1fe02f273afc34baa7db1e8256c1e@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1769469835258-WN6525HAZUPVE7CS0NC1/2026+Free+Commun
 ity+Yoga+on+The+Dock+for+Squarespace+calendar+%28296+x+190+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Free Community Yoga on The Floathouse Dock — First Fridays F
 ridays | 6:00–7:00 pm Join us for Free Community Yoga on The Floathouse 
 Dock \, an all-levels class that flows right along with Friday nights in d
 owntown Petaluma. As the city eases into the evening—and sometimes live 
 music drifts through the air—this outdoor practice invites you to move\,
  stretch\, and be part of the moment. Held on our dock—right on the Peta
 luma River—this class is relaxed\, welcoming\, and rooted in community. 
 Each session is sponsored by a local small business\, who’ll be on site 
 after class to meet you and share in the evening. Free to attend\, but reg
 istration is required due to limited space. Reserve your spot here. Bring 
 your own mat if you have one (we’ll have a few extras)\, dress for the w
